{"articleNo":"2710","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2710&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 1학기 등록금 분할납부 안내(재학생, 복학예정자)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.01.12","hit":"13724","attachments":[{"name":"일반대학원.JPG","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2710&attachNo=1537"},{"name":"대학,산업대학원,교육대학원.JPG","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2710&attachNo=1602"},{"name":"컨설팅학과,컨설팅대학원.JPG","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2710&attachNo=2542"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#003300\">- 2011학년도 1학기 등록금 분할납부 안내 -</font></font><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font size=\"3\">(재학생, 복학예정자)<br></font></strong><font color=\"#000000\"><br><strong><font size=\"2\"><hr></font></strong></font>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">분할납부 신청 명단은 신청서 접수 다음 날&nbsp;<br>’학사안내 공지사항’에 게시합니다.(학번만 표시함)<br><br><hr><br><br>1. <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffcc\">분할납부 <strong><font color=\"#800000\">신청기간</font></strong> : <u><font color=\"#003366\"><strong>02.01.(화)~02.11.(금) 오후 6시까지</strong></font></u></font><br><br><br>2. <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffcc\">분할납부 <strong><font color=\"#800000\">신청방법</font></strong> : </font><font color=\"#003366\"><strong><u><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffcc\">우편신청(또는 방문신청)</font><br></u></strong></font><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- <strong>본인도장, 보호자도장을 반드시 찍어 주시기 바랍니다.<br></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (본인 및 보호자도장이 없는 경우에는 분할납부를 신청할수 없습니다.)<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 우편신청시 주소 : 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공대 경리팀(본관 504호)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (우편번호 : 730-701)<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp; - 방문신청시 : 경리팀(본관&nbsp;504호)으로 오시기 바랍니다.</font>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br>3. <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffcc\">분할납부 <font color=\"#800000\"><strong>고지서발급</strong></font></font> : 원스톱서비스에서 발급, <u>2월 16일부터 발급 예정</u></font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br>4. <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffcc\">분할납부 <strong><font color=\"#800000\">납부기간 및 납부장소<br></font></strong></font>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 1차분을 납부기간에 납부하지 않을시 분할납부 신청이 취소됩니다.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp; <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\">-&nbsp;<font color=\"#003366\"><strong><u>1차</u></strong></font> : </font><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><font color=\"#003366\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">02.22.(화)~02.25.(금) [농협, 대구은행, 신한은행, 우체국]</font><br></strong></font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- <strong><u><font color=\"#003366\">2차</font></u></strong> : </font><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">03.24.(목)~03.25.(금) [농협]<br></font></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- <strong><u><font color=\"#003366\">3차</font></u></strong> : </font><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><font color=\"#003366\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">04.21.(목)~04.22.(금) [농협]</font><br></strong></font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- <strong><u><font color=\"#003366\">4차</font></u></strong> : </font><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" color=\"#000000\">05.17.(화)~05.18.(수)&nbsp;[농협]<br></font></strong><br><br></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">5. 분할 납부 금액 : ’분할납부신청서’ 참조하시기 바랍니다.<br></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br><br>6. 분할납부신청서 양식 : 붙임 참조(양식은 절대 수정 불가합니다.)<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - <u>’대학, 산업대학원, 교육대학원용</u>’과 ’<u>일반대학원용’</u>,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>’컨설팅학과, 컨설팅대학원용</u>’&nbsp;신청서가 다릅니다.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 신청서를&nbsp;정확하게 작성하여 주시기 바랍니다.</font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br>7. 2011학년도 1학기 <font color=\"#800000\">휴학시에는 등록금을 완납</font>하여야 합니다.</font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br>8. 2011학년도 1학기 <font color=\"#800000\">재입학자 및 한국장학재단 학자금융자를 받는&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학생, 신용카드로 등록금을 납부하는 학생은&nbsp;분할납부를 신청할 수 없습니다.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; (분할납부 신청과 중복되지 않습니다.)</font></font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br>9. 분할납부 문의전화 : 054-478-7115 (경리팀)<br><br><br><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2011. 01. 12.</strong><br><br><br><strong><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 총&nbsp;&nbsp; 무&nbsp;&nbsp; 과&nbsp;&nbsp; 장</font></strong></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
